SUMMARY:Yoga at the Vineyard
DESCRIPTION:Beginner Yoga at the Vineyard in Davis Tuesday\, September 22 | 5:45–6:45 PMTicket Includes: Yoga ClassStart your week with fresh air\, gentle movement\, and beautiful vineyard views!Join us for a relaxing outdoor yoga class designed for all experience levels\, especially those new to yoga. Our professional instructors will guide you through the fundamentals with gentle stretches\, basic poses\, and mindful movement in a welcoming\, supportive setting.Surrounded by our organic vineyard\, wildflowers\, and peaceful morning scenery\, it’s the perfect way to stretch\, breathe\, and ease into your week.What to Bring:• Yoga mat• Towel• WaterCome stretch\, breathe\, and start your week the Great Bear way!
