SUMMARY:The Folk Music Folks and Cousins Maine Lobster
DESCRIPTION:Live Music & Food Truck Friday in Davis  Friday\, September 25 | 5–8:30 PM\nThe weekend starts here! \nJoin us at the vineyard for an easygoing Friday evening filled with award-winning wines\, live music\, delicious seafood\, and beautiful vineyard views. Grab your friends\, grab a glass\, and settle in for a night of good food\, great music\, and plenty of time to relax. \n LIVE MUSIC | Folk Music Folks | 6–7:30 PMTake a musical journey around the world with Folk Music Folks\, playing lively folk tunes from different cultures and corners of the globe.  Their unique sound is the perfect soundtrack for a glass of wine and an evening under the vineyard sky.\n FOOD | Cousins Maine Lobster | 5–8:30 PMGet ready for a seafood feast! Cousins Maine Lobster will be serving up delicious lobster rolls and other seafood favorites.  Come hungry and make dinner part of your vineyard experience!\n MORE TO SNACK ONLooking for something to nibble on with your wine? We’ll also have cheese\, salami\, olives\, crackers\, and other snacks available for purchase.\n TICKET INCLUDES: One glass of wine Live music A beautiful evening at the vineyard\nBring your friends\, enjoy the views\, sip something delicious\, and let the weekend begin! Friday nights were made for wine\, music\, and good company.
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/the-folk-music-folks-and-cousins-maine-lobster/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards 24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Highway128PressTrip_GreatBearVineyards_2024_MaxWhittaker_12-Copy-scaled-OoIRnT.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
