SUMMARY:Talk Theology to Me: Questions about Faith & Life
DESCRIPTION:Iama Embodied Community\nWhat questions about faith\, God\, Sc
 ripture\, or spirituality have you been carrying around?\n\n**Talk Theolog
 y to Me** is an informal\, discussion-based gathering for anyone who is cu
 rious about faith and the questions that shape our lives. No theological d
 egree—or even a fully formed belief system—is required. Just bring you
 r questions and your willingness to listen and explore.\nTogether\, we’l
 l have a facilitated conversation drawing from **Scripture\, theology\, an
 d lived experience**. We’ll make room for curiosity\, uncertainty\, diff
 erent perspectives\, and the kinds of questions that don’t always have e
 asy answers.\n\n### What to expect\n\n* A welcoming\, low-pressure convers
 ation\n* Space to ask honest questions about faith and spirituality\n* Ref
 lection on Scripture and our own lived experiences\n* Respect for differen
 t perspectives and places in the faith journey\n* An opportunity to connec
 t with others in a meaningful way\n\nThis is a space for exploration rathe
 r than debate. You don’t need to have all the answers—in fact\, questi
 ons are encouraged.\n**📅 Tuesday\, September 29**\n**🕕 6:00–8:00 P
 M**\n\nCome curious. Come as you are. Bring a question—or just come list
 en.\n\n### About the Facilitator\n\n**Rola** is an ordained Presbyterian m
 inister\, yoga teacher\, and trauma-informed practitioner whose approach t
 o spirituality is progressive\, universalist\, and inclusive. She believes
  faith should serve the growth and flourishing of human beings—not limit
  them—and is passionate about creating spaces where people can bring the
 ir questions\, experiences\, doubts\, and hopes without fear of judgment.\
 nP.S. This meeting is not about teaching any particular faith.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/mindful-embodied-spirituality/events/
 316464111/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260908T001524Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260908T001524Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
